{
  "uid": "fsp-releases",
  "title": "FSP releases & plugins",
  "description": "What runs where, what you can roll back to, and which plugin versions still need a four-eyes registration.",
  "tags": [
    "fsp"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "editable": false,
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "repo",
        "type": "constant",
        "query": "arunsoman/FinancialServicesPlatform",
        "hide": 2,
        "current": {
          "text": "arunsoman/FinancialServicesPlatform",
          "value": "arunsoman/FinancialServicesPlatform"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 7
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Roll back to a tagged release\n1. Pick a release in **Releases you can roll back to** and click **Roll back to this release** \u2014 it opens the GitHub *rollback* workflow.\n2. **Run workflow** \u2192 choose the environment, paste the release name (e.g. `prod-2026.12.01-42`), give a reason.\n3. Production asks a second person to approve. Nothing is rebuilt: the tag's exact images come back; the database stays (expand/contract migrations).\n\n### Upgrade (or downgrade) a plugin version\n1. In **Plugin drift**, anything not `in_sync` needs a registration. **Open manifest** shows the exact JSON for *that environment* (its own public key is already in it).\n2. Admin portal \u203a **Plugins** \u203a **Register**: paste the manifest (maker). A **different** admin approves it in **Approvals** (checker). Within 5 minutes the row turns `in_sync`.\n3. **Plugin versions you can register** lists every version shipped to an environment \u2014 register an older one to go back.\n\nReleases + plugin data refresh every 5 minutes and after every deploy. Logs \u2192 *FSP logs*; CPU/RAM/disk \u2192 *FSP containers & disk*."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Running now",
      "description": "What each environment runs. Different commits = staging and production have drifted (normal between a staging deploy and its promotion).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prom"
          },
          "expr": "fsp_release_info",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true,
              "Value": true
            },
            "renameByName": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "commit"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "title": "Commit on GitHub",
                    "url": "https://github.com/${repo}/commit/${__data.fields.commit}",
                    "targetBlank": true
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "release"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "title": "Code at this tag",
                    "url": "https://github.com/${repo}/tree/${__data.fields.release}",
                    "targetBlank": true
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Staging vs production",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "description": "1 distinct commit = production runs what staging runs. 2 = staging is ahead (or production was rolled back). Compare the commits in 'Running now'.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prom"
          },
          "instant": true,
          "expr": "count(count by (commit) (fsp_release_info{env=~\"staging|production\"}))"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "Same commit",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "2": {
                  "text": "Drifted \u2014 staging \u2260 production",
                  "color": "orange",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Releases you can roll back to",
      "description": "Release bundles kept on the server. Older tags can still be rolled back to from GitHub \u203a Actions \u203a rollback.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prom"
          },
          "expr": "fsp_release_available",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true,
              "Value": true
            },
            "renameByName": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "release"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "title": "Roll back to this release",
                    "url": "https://github.com/${repo}/actions/workflows/rollback.yml",
                    "targetBlank": true
                  },
                  {
                    "title": "Code at this tag",
                    "url": "https://github.com/${repo}/tree/${__data.fields.release}",
                    "targetBlank": true
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "commit"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "title": "Commit on GitHub",
                    "url": "https://github.com/${repo}/commit/${__data.fields.commit}",
                    "targetBlank": true
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Plugin drift",
      "description": "shipped = plugin version the running process has; registered = what the gateway routes. Registration is four-eyes in the admin portal (machines are never maker or checker).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prom"
          },
          "expr": "fsp_plugin_drift",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true,
              "Value": true
            },
            "renameByName": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "manifest_url"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "title": "Open manifest (copy into Admin \u203a Plugins \u203a Register)",
                    "url": "${__data.fields.manifest_url}",
                    "targetBlank": true
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "state"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "in_sync": {
                        "color": "green",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "pending_approval": {
                        "color": "blue",
                        "index": 1
                      },
                      "behind": {
                        "color": "orange",
                        "index": 2
                      },
                      "not_registered": {
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 3
                      },
                      "ahead": {
                        "color": "orange",
                        "index": 4
                      },
                      "key_mismatch": {
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 5
                      },
                      "content_mismatch": {
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 6
                      },
                      "plugin_down": {
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 7
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "env"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "title": "Staging admin portal",
                    "url": "https://fsp.stage.afriqpay.com/admin/",
                    "targetBlank": true
                  },
                  {
                    "title": "Production admin portal",
                    "url": "https://fsp.afriqpay.com/admin/",
                    "targetBlank": true
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Operations shipped but not routed",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prom"
          },
          "expr": "fsp_plugin_unrouted_operations",
          "legendFormat": "{{env}} {{code}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "basic",
        "showUnfilled": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Plugin versions you can register (upgrade / downgrade)",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 28,
        "w": 16,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prom"
          },
          "expr": "fsp_plugin_manifest_available",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true,
              "Value": true
            },
            "renameByName": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "manifest_url"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "title": "Open manifest",
                    "url": "${__data.fields.manifest_url}",
                    "targetBlank": true
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      }
    }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "FSP",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "fsp"
      ],
      "asDropdown": false
    }
  ]
}